    "name": "Kingdom's Path",
    "steam_appid": 3740370,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kingdom\u2019s Path</strong> is a strategic tower defense game with roguelite elements, where you expand your map by placing randomly offered terrain zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each zone includes predefined paths, elevation levels, and tower placement slots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each wave, a new zone reshapes the enemy route based on your placement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place towers on higher ground to gain increased range, and adapt your strategy using the passive effects of your chosen leader.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new blueprints over time to build diverse towers and support structures, allowing you to respond to changing conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With roguelite mechanics and meaningful zone placement, <strong>Kingdom\u2019s Path</strong> offers high replayability and strategic depth in every run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shape the Path, Shape the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 After each wave, choose from several randomly offered zones to expand your map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each zone includes preset roads and varying terrain elevations. Zones must connect to existing paths, making every placement a tactical decision.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Elevation-Based Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 Towers built on higher ground gain extended range.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Placing towers at the right height and time will maximize your defensive power.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blueprint System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 After each wave, choose a blueprint \u2014 a new tower or support structure \u2014 to add to your arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These can be constructed with gold in future waves, letting you adjust your strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelite Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 Unlock new leaders, passive effects, and structures as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each leader introduces a different playstyle. With randomized zones, blueprints, and enemy patterns, no two runs are the same.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kingdom\u2019s Path</strong> is a strategic tower defense game with roguelite elements, where you expand your map by placing randomly offered terrain zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each zone includes predefined paths, elevation levels, and tower placement slots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each wave, a new zone reshapes the enemy route based on your placement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place towers on higher ground to gain increased range, and adapt your strategy using the passive effects of your chosen leader.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new blueprints over time to build diverse towers and support structures, allowing you to respond to changing conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With roguelite mechanics and meaningful zone placement, <strong>Kingdom\u2019s Path</strong> offers high replayability and strategic depth in every run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shape the Path, Shape the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 After each wave, choose from several randomly offered zones to expand your map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each zone includes preset roads and varying terrain elevations. Zones must connect to existing paths, making every placement a tactical decision.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Elevation-Based Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 Towers built on higher ground gain extended range.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Placing towers at the right height and time will maximize your defensive power.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blueprint System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 After each wave, choose a blueprint \u2014 a new tower or support structure \u2014 to add to your arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These can be constructed with gold in future waves, letting you adjust your strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelite Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 Unlock new leaders, passive effects, and structures as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each leader introduces a different playstyle. With randomized zones, blueprints, and enemy patterns, no two runs are the same.</p>",
